Here’s Every Discontinued Flavor in the Ben & Jerry’s Flavor Graveyard
By 
 The Quirky Travel Guy  / 
 January 8, 2024  / 
USA, Vermont / 
Food, Quirky Attractions, Quirky Best OfShare on X (Twitter)
Share on Facebook
Share on Pinterest
Share on Email
Ben & Jerry have always had an awesome sense of humor. So when the famous ice cream company discontinued many of its decadent flavor combinations over the years, they decided to turn these unsuccessful offerings into a tourist attraction.
Behold, the Ben & Jerry’s flavor graveyard, complete with headstones and poetic epitaphs for most of their abandoned flavors!
As a hardcore ice cream junkie, I felt a sense of nostalgia visiting the Ben & Jerry’s graveyard, because it contains two of the most delicious ice cream flavors I’ve ever tasted. RIP Oatmeal Cookie Chunk and Clusterfluff!
